    "requestNotes": [
      {
        "note": "API version 2026-10-21 returns a 400 for temperature, top_p or top_k, even at the default value. Earlier API versions return it for non-default values on Claude 4.7 and later models. Remove them and guide behaviour with prompting.",
        "url": "https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/api/migration-2026-10-21#sampling-parameters"
      },
      {
        "note": "API version 2026-10-21 returns a 400 for a document block directly in an assistant message, and for a non-empty citations array on a text block in a user message.",
        "url": "https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/api/migration-2026-10-21#breaking-changes"
      },
      {
        "note": "The first SDK versions on 2026-10-21 are anthropic 2.0.0 (Python) and @anthropic-ai/sdk 1.0.0 (TypeScript), with SDK code changes of their own.",
        "url": "https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/api/migration-2026-10-21"
      },
      {
        "note": "claude-opus-5-5 rejects thinking {\"type\":\"disabled\"} and manual budget_tokens; adaptive thinking is always on and the effort parameter controls its depth. thinking blocks come first in the response, so find text by block type.",
        "url": "https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/models/opus-5-5/migration-guide"
      },
      {
        "note": "claude-opus-5-5 rejects tool_choice {\"type\":\"any\"} and {\"type\":\"tool\"}, and messages that end in a prefilled assistant turn. Use structured outputs or system prompt instructions in place of prefill.",
        "url": "https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/models/opus-5-5/migration-guide"
      },
      {
        "note": "claude-sonnet-5-5 returns a 400 for thinking budgets, sampling parameters, assistant prefill, forced tool choice and thinking {\"type\":\"disabled\"}.",
        "url": "https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/models/sonnet-5-5/migration-guide"
      },
      {
        "note": "claude-haiku-5-5 needs thinking {\"type\":\"adaptive\"} in place of budget_tokens, no sampling parameters and no assistant prefill. Computer use moves to computer_toolset_20260801. Handle stop_reason \"refusal\".",
        "url": "https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/models/haiku-5-5/migration-guide"
      },
      {
        "note": "The same text produces about 30 percent more tokens on Claude Haiku 5.5 than on Claude Haiku 4.5, so revisit max_tokens and cost estimates.",
        "url": "https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/models/haiku-5-5/migration-guide#recount-tokens"
      }
    ]
  },
